  (1, 'col-raiser-firenze', 'Col Raiser → Rifugio Firenze', 'Puez-Odle Nature Park', 'No. 1', 'easy', 0, 'Out & back', 'Jun – Oct', 5, 160, 2, 2090, 'Rifugio Firenze', 'Fermeda / Odle', 'Col Raiser gondola from S. Cristina', 46.5848, 11.7457, 46.5875, 11.7583, '[[46.58484,11.74551],[46.58507,11.74579],[46.5859,11.745],[46.58621,11.74502],[46.58733,11.74524],[46.58744,11.74538],[46.58743,11.74576],[46.5878,11.74642],[46.58818,11.74651],[46.58868,11.74615],[46.58894,11.74659],[46.58888,11.74747],[46.58958,11.74845],[46.58989,11.7493],[46.58962,11.75118],[46.58976,11.75253],[46.58883,11.75432],[46.58864,11.75544],[46.58831,11.75597],[46.58814,11.75763],[46.5875,11.75807],[46.58758,11.7582]]', '[[46.58484,11.74551,2105,0],[46.58974,11.75005,2128,0.9],[46.58758,11.7582,2040,1.7]]', '/gpx/col-raiser-firenze.gpx', 'An easy, gradual walk across open alp from the top of the Col Raiser gondola to the Regensburger Hütte (Rifugio Firenze, 2,037 m), tucked right beneath the Fermeda towers. Big-mountain scenery with very little effort.'),
  (1, 'alpe-di-siusi', 'Alpe di Siusi Meadow Walk', 'Seiser Alm / Sciliar', 'Meadow paths', 'easy', 0, 'Loop', 'May – Oct', 6, 150, 2.5, 2005, 'Mont Sëuc', 'Sassolungo & Sciliar views', 'Mont Sëuc cable car from Ortisei', 46.5655, 11.668, 46.56, 11.6645, '[[46.5655,11.668],[46.56,11.6645],[46.5575,11.667],[46.56,11.6715],[46.5655,11.668]]', '[]', NULL, 'Europe’s largest high-altitude alpine meadow, rolling green under the Sassolungo and Sciliar. Wide, almost flat paths make this the easiest big-view day from Ortisei — perfect for a slow afternoon or a picnic.'),
  (1, 'sassolungo-circuit', 'Sassolungo Circuit (Friedrich-August-Weg)', 'Sassolungo / Langkofel', 'No. 557 / 4', 'medium', 0, 'Loop', 'Jul – Sep', 11, 600, 5.5, 2300, 'Rif. Friedrich August', 'Sassolungo 3181 m', 'Passo Sella (bus/drive via Selva)', 46.5081, 11.7673, 46.5004, 11.7452, '[[46.5081,11.7673],[46.504,11.756],[46.5004,11.7452],[46.51,11.733],[46.5199,11.7237],[46.5235,11.734],[46.5165,11.75],[46.512,11.76],[46.5081,11.7673]]', '[]', NULL, 'A grand loop right around the base of the Sassolungo/Langkofel massif, weaving between rock towers, scree and high pasture with the Friedrich-August hut along the way. A proper full day of moderate alpine walking.'),
